api.kdoc:
Creates a [Debouncer] and immediately registers a suspending callback.

```kotlin
private val searchDebouncer = KDebounce(viewModelScope, 300.milliseconds) { q -> search(q) }
// in UI: onValueChange = { searchDebouncer.emit(it) }
```

